# Shared Issues

## TL;DR

- Record only sanitized actionable summaries here; never paste raw logs, tokens, accounts or private paths.
- Keep private reproduction details in ignored context/issues.local.md; legacy context/current-issues.md stays local.
- Link reproduction and verification evidence; unknowns are not conclusions.

## Open issues

No recorded shared issues.

## Record format

For each issue name its status (open, analyzing, approved, fixing, pending verification, resolved), sanitized symptom, suspected project-relative path, fix direction, definition of success, and source/check evidence pointer. Preserve unresolved issues at handoff; do not duplicate this queue in memory.
